On the fifth floor, help had been asked for.
On the other end, Mikado Ryuugamine sat with a foreign classmate’s I need you and a girlfriend-shaped gravity he had not claimed, trying to decide whether Curtis Nightstar asking for help was an insult, a trap, or the first time the city had treated him like he mattered.
